# Elas il-Kor gains its controller 1 life for each OTHER creature that enters under their control, and each opponent loses
# 1 life for each other creature of theirs that dies. Elas entering gains nothing ("another"), Bot2's Dwarven Trader
# entering and dying gains and drains nothing ("you control"), and Bot1's Eager Cadet entering gains exactly 1 and dying
# costs Bot2 exactly 1 (CR 603.2, 700.4).

